### START: ignored/bootstrap-v4-artifacts
# Reproducible build output (core, plugin, package archive/manifest): the source
# to rebuild it byte-identically is committed; the binaries are not, to avoid
# committing large rebuildable artifacts into repository history. Their SHA-256
# identity is independently fixed in the evidence chain (reports, reviews).
